            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "There are 13 transcripts of interviews with different categories of respondents: farmers, architects, urban planners, project managers, public servants. There are 14 image files with pictures and 3 video files recorded during a fieldtrip in the Overdiepse polder. There is a file containing a template of the information sheet and the consent form distributed to the interviewees. \r\nFor further information regarding this research project and the RECOMS MSCA ITN please access https://recoms.eu/."
